DESCRIPTION:------------\n\nInstructions\n------------\n\n*\n\nChoose a bus
 iness or enterprise that has been involved in a scandal within the last 10
  years.\n\n*\n\nBriefly describe the business and what it does.\n\n*\n\nEx
 plain why the scandal happened and how society responded.\n\n*\n\nReflect 
 on what the business could have done to avoid the scandal\, using the ethi
 cal frameworks we’ve covered.\n\n*\n\nSuggest which ethical framework(s)
  the business could use now to recover from the scandal.\n\nGuidelines:\n\
 n*\n\nYour post should be 100- 200 words.\n\n*\n\nAfter posting\, respond 
 to at least 2 classmates by offering constructive feedback\, asking questi
 ons\, or adding new perspectives.\n\n*\n\nPlease note that this is a grade
 d activity.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Discussion #1: Corporate scandals and Ethical Lessons [Responsible_
 Enterprise]
