DTSTART;VALUE=DATE;VALUE=DATE:20261018
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Imagine it’s the year 2050. Your mission has grown into a suc
 cessful\, responsible enterprise. Now\, you're publishing your first publi
 c Impact Report to showcase the long-term social\, environmental\, and eco
 nomic contributions of your solution.\n\nUsing Corporate Social Responsibi
 lity (CSR) principles and Futures Thinking tools\, reflect on how your wor
 k has created systemic\, ethical\, and sustainable impact.\n\n------------
 \nInstructions\n------------\n\nYour 2050 Impact Report should be between 
 1\,000 and 1\,500 words (no more\, no less) and must include the following
  sections:\n\n* Executive Summary (200 words minimum)\nA high-level overvi
 ew of the impact your enterprise has made since its inception.\n\n* Your M
 ission & Vision in 2050\nHow has your mission evolved over the years? What
  future-oriented values and principles have guided its growth?\n\n* Key CS
 R Pillars in Action\nUsing the CSR Triple Bottom Line (People\, Planet\, P
 rofit)\, provide examples of how your enterprise has:\n\n* Created social 
 value\n\n* Reduced environmental harm\n\n* Contributed to economic sustain
 ability\n\n* Signals & Trends You Responded To\nWhat social\, environmenta
 l\, or technological shifts did you anticipate using Futures Thinking tool
 s (e.g.\, scenario planning\, signals\, forecasting)? How did these guide 
 your innovation?\n\n* Impact Metrics\nShare some measurable outcomes:\n\n*
  Number of people reached or employed\n\n* Resources saved or restored\n\n
 * Systems changed or improved\n\n* Reflections & Lessons Learned \nWhat w
 orked? What didn’t? How did you ensure you remained an ethical and respo
 nsible enterprise over time?\n\n------------------------\nSubmission Instr
 uctions \n\n------------------------\n\n*\n\nSubmit a PDF document \n\n*
 \n\nUse Times New Roman or Montserrat\, font size 12 pt.\n\n*\n\nText shou
 ld be justified and 1.5 line spacing should be applied throughout the docu
 ment.\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------
 -------------------------------------------------------------------------\
 n- Please ensure that your report includes in-text citations and a referen
 ce list formatted according to APA 7 guidelines.\n\n- In this assessment y
 ou're not allowed to use AI. This should be the imagination of your missio
 ns' impact. \n\n- Be sure to stay within the required word count of 1\,00
 0 to 1\,500 words. Marks will be deducted for failure to follow these inst
 ructions.\nAll the Best!\n------------------------------------------------
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ----------------
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Formative Assignment 2: Mission Impact Report 2050 [Responsible_Ent
 erprise]
